# Git must not rewrite these line endings.
#
# RFC 6350 requires CRLF in a vCard. Committing one from Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true strips the CR, and strict parsers - iOS Contacts among
# them - can reject the result. Marking them binary keeps the bytes the
# generator wrote, whatever platform commits them.
*.vcf -text

# Generated QR artwork: never diffed, never merged.
qr-*.svg -text -diff
